    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_42_29" sourceRef="RetryAllowed_42" targetRef="Review_42" name="Yes — review current visibility" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_42_30" sourceRef="RetryAllowed_42" targetRef="Denied_42" name="No" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="Reasons_42">
      <bpmn:text>Moderation rules (FR-REV-08–14)
Manual Admin/Owner judgement only.
Hide: Spam, Abusive language, Off-topic content, Sexual content, or Other with specified explanation.
Unhide: restore hidden review; no new hiding reason required.
Retain prior history.
No sentiment analysis, profanity classification or automated dispute resolution.
Customer rating/comment/photos stay unchanged.</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Assoc_Reasons_42" sourceRef="Validate_42" targetRef="Reasons_42" associationDirection="None" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="History_42">
      <bpmn:text>Protected save / history
Recheck expected version and reason at save.
Visibility + action/reason + acting Owner account + timestamp save together.
No duplicate history for matching repeated save.
Conflict/failure retains current records and draft.
Hidden reviews remain stored; do not delete feedback or media.
BPMN-41 owns review submission; moderation never resubmits or changes the purchase.</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Assoc_History_42" sourceRef="Save_42" targetRef="History_42" associationDirection="None" />
    <bpmn:textAnnotation id="Boundaries_42">
      <bpmn:text>Visibility and reuse boundaries
Hidden: excluded from public feedback, retained for Owner management/history.
Unhidden: visible again under saved state.
Authorized Owner page access is an entry precondition (BPMN-30).
BPMN-41 owns review creation/eligibility.
No Owner-preapproval stage, external notice or automated filtering is introduced.</bpmn:text>
    </bpmn:textAnnotation>
    <bpmn:association id="Assoc_Boundaries_42" sourceRef="Refresh_42" targetRef="Boundaries_42" associationDirection="None" />
